# Redistributable sound names shipped with FastPrompter.
#
# Operator-authorized full sound set (2026-11-19). This list was expanded from
# the original 49 synthesized cues to include the complete 1290-file local WAV
# library the operator explicitly authorized for redistribution in the public
# EXE. The previous "original synthesis only" policy was retired at the
# operator's direction; see the v0.8.74 release notes. Everything the app can
# play outside src/fastprompter/sound (the managed library and addon root)
# remains user-local and is never packaged.
